      "persona": "Whitehat Hacker",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Dr. Mira Sen:</b> Reconstruct the evidence chain before the report reaches the <b>authorized incident owner</b>. A defensible handoff connects authorization, collection, interpretation, and remediation in order.",
